+2.  **Concatenation:** Concatenate the normalized spatial coordinates with the timestamps along the last dimension:
     $$ \mathbf{pts}_{\text{cat}} = \text{concat}(\mathbf{pts}_{\text{norm}}, \mathbf{t}) $$
